    {
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10},
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Runtime admin\n\nSet dashboard variables **`api_origin`** (browser-reachable API base URL, e.g. `https://your-host` — same origin as Grafana in production avoids CORS) and **`X-Admin-Token`** to match **`ADMIN_API_TOKEN`** in `pb_backend/app.env.example`.\n\n**Canvas resize (Phase 2, ADR-003):** expand-only `POST /api/admin/canvas/resize` with JSON `{\"width\":<int>,\"height\":<int>}`. On success, `canvas_dimensions` updates and WebSocket clients get `{\"event\":\"RESIZE\",...}`.\n\nUse the **Canvas resize** panel below (Volkov Labs Business Forms)."
      },
      "title": "Operator notes",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "datasource", "uid": "grafana"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 12, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 17},
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "buttonGroup": {"orientation": "center", "size": "md"},
        "confirmModal": {
          "body": "Expand canvas to the given width×height? New cells are filled white; shrink is rejected.",
          "cancel": "Cancel",
          "columns": {
            "include": ["name", "oldValue", "newValue"],
            "name": "Label",
            "newValue": "New Value",
            "oldValue": "Old Value"
          },
          "confirm": "Resize",
          "elementDisplayMode": "modified",
          "title": "Confirm canvas resize"
        },
        "elementValueChanged": "",
        "elements": [
          {
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "width",
            "labelWidth": 12,
            "min": 1,
            "section": "",
            "title": "Width (px)",
            "tooltip": "Must be ≥ current width (expand-only).",
            "type": "number",
            "unit": "",
            "value": null
          },
          {
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "height",
